<p>Raging flames burn foes and allies alike, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">47, 63, 75, 86, 95</acronym> fire damage in a radius of 5 each turn for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>